  "task_id": "tmm_perform_one_bounded_tmm_thickness_optimization_f_f75ec5654e",
  "user_request_original": "Perform one bounded TMM thickness optimization for an exactly 16-layer planar stack. Use the fixed material sequence from the incident side: HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2 / HfO2 / SiO2. Optimize only the physical thickness of each finite layer within the user-declared bounds. Do not optimize material identity or layer count in this route. Optimize a 16-layer dielectric stack on fused silica substrate for solar-blind UV filtering. Material sequence: SiO2|HfO2|Al2O3|SiO2|HfO2|Al2O3|SiO2|HfO2|Al2O3|SiO2|HfO2|Al2O3|SiO2|HfO2|Al2O3|SiO2. Initialize all layer thicknesses to quarter-wave optical thickness at 267 nm center wavelength (thickness = 267/(4*n_material)) with bounded Gaussian noise +/-8 nm. Enforce minimum thickness floor of 15 nm for all layers. Optimize thicknesses within 15-200 nm bounds using gradient-based optimizer. Evaluate at normal incidence. Maximize transmittance in 255-280 nm band, minimize transmittance in 300-700 nm and 700-1100 nm bands. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 255-280 nm, 300-700 nm, 700-1100 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 255–280 nm. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Transmittance in 300–700 nm; Transmittance in 700–1100 nm. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers; No metal layers; Only conventional depositable inorganic dielectric materials.",
  "normalized_request_english": "Perform a bounded thickness optimization of a fixed 16-layer planar dielectric stack (SiO2/HfO2/Al2O3 repeating sequence on fused silica) to maximize transmittance in the 255–280 nm solar-blind UV band while suppressing transmittance in the 300–700 nm visible and 700–1100 nm near-infrared bands. Optimize only layer physical thicknesses within 15–200 nm bounds using a gradient-based optimizer at normal incidence.",
